BT /F2 14 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 658 Tm (Abstract) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 629 Tm (The Transformer is a neural network architecture that uses attention to represent) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 612 Tm (relationships between tokens in a sequence.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 582 Tm (Instead of processing words one at a time, it allows each position to gather information from) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 565 Tm (other positions in parallel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 535 Tm (This short reading sample introduces the encoder-decoder structure and explains how scaled) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 518 Tm (dot-product attention works.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 478 Tm (1 Introduction) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 449 Tm (Language contains dependencies that can span many words: a pronoun may refer to a noun that) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 432 Tm (appeared much earlier.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 402 Tm (Attention creates a direct path between these positions, allowing the model to combine local) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 385 Tm (details with wider context.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 355 Tm (The original architecture contains an encoder that reads the input and a decoder that) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf .2 .25 .2 rg 1 0 0 1 55 338 Tm (generates the output.) Tj ET
BT /F3 8 Tf .6 .65 .55 rg 1 0 0 1 55 18 Tm (1 / 3   -   Educational sample, not a research publication) Tj ET
